# Design/inspiration reference material (screenshots, video frames) — not
# part of the deliverable, may be third-party content.
/reference

# Raw couple photos, pre-optimization. Kept outside public/ deliberately —
# anything under public/ is copied verbatim into the production build, and
# these may carry EXIF/GPS metadata from phones. Only the stripped WebP
# copies in public/images/couple/optimized/ (produced by
# `npm run optimize:photos`) are committed and used by the site.
/assets-source/

